ts\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Trinket Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Trinket Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Quori-Infused_Core.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Quori-Infused_Core.png/420px-Quori-Infused_Core.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"420\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Quori-Infused_Core.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Cauldron_of_Cadence\" title=\"Cauldron of Cadence\">Cauldron of Cadence</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Set_Augment:_Wild_Fortitude\" title=\"Item:Set Augment: Wild Fortitude\">Set Augment: Wild Fortitude</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This was taken from the Lord of Blades, and has clear signs of Quori influence. You should probably hold onto it, at least for a little while...</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li>This <a href=\"/page/Minor_Artifact\" title=\"Minor Artifact\">Minor Artifact</a> has a maximum of 3 filigree slots.</li>\n<li>Can be crafted into the <a href=\"/page/Item:Set_Augment:_Wild_Fortitude\" title=\"Item:Set Augment: Wild Fortitude\">Wild Fortitude</a> <a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot#Set_augments\" title=\"Augment Slot\">set augment</a> for +3 Artifact Bonus to <a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221119\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.136 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.186 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4121/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33321/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11558/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  154.662      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  154.662      1 -total\n 97.33%  150.537      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 91.75%  141.896     60 Template:IO\n 31.01%   47.960      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 29.69%   45.912      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 28.32%   43.807      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 27.06%   41.846     10 Template:Popup\n 26.86%   41.541      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.45%   30.082      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:84289-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817221119 and revision id 681173. Rendering was trigge